# photo-forager — optional API keys
#
# Wikimedia Commons and Rawpixel need NO key and work out of the box.
# Add either key below to light up that source (both free, instant signup):
#
#   Pexels   -> https://www.pexels.com/api/   (free, no attribution required)
#   Unsplash -> https://unsplash.com/oauth/applications   (free; NOTE: the
#               Unsplash API Terms require crediting the photographer + Unsplash
#               on every result — photo-forager labels these automatically)
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (which is gitignored) and fill in your keys.

PEXELS_API_KEY=
UNSPLASH_ACCESS_KEY=
